      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Output of the acoustic analysis of a segment of the Story, stored as a digital object (e.g. an F0 data file or a waveform or spectrogram image) and not as text. Because it is computed on the non-anonymized voice it may allow speaker identification."
      }
